name hexboard
category Package
revision 62102
shortdesc For drawing Hex boards and games
longdesc hexboard is a package for LaTeX that should also work with
longdesc LuaTeX and XeTeX, that provides functionality for drawing Hex
longdesc boards and games. The aim is a clean, clear design with
longdesc flexibility for drawing different sorts of Hex diagrams.
